msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/institutional/strengths-and-limits.md:61
msgid ""
"Every generated page on this site repeats that invitation, in those "
"words, for the same reason: a figure you cannot re-derive is a figure you"
" are being asked to take on faith."
msgstr ""

